coding."},"1125":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Missing credential or invalid certificate"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Operation mode, validating CA, dates, revocation and credential delivery by Gateway. Do not confuse server TLS trust with the bootstrap CA."},"1127":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Webhook denies, times out or responds without authorization"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"Configuration, connectivity and JSON response with `authorized: true`. There is no automatic fallback to `NO_AUTH`."},"1129":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting#error-codes-and-diagnostics","content":"`unexpected status code: <n>: redirects are not followed`"},"1130":{"