/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"cert-manager; para TLS de confianza, un emisor de confianza o un Secret TLS ya poblado"},"348":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Datos persistentes de la aplicación"},"349":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"PersistentVolumeClaims necesarios para el almacenamiento local predeterminado de KMS y VA"},"350":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Una StorageClass, almacenamiento físico, backups y un backend compartido/externo cuando el escalado lo requiera"},"351":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Integraciones opcionales"},"352":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Puntos de configuración para observabilidad, conectores AWS y conectividad PKCS#11/HSM"},"353":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Los backends de observabilidad, credenciales cloud y un HSM de producción o servicio externo de claves"},"354":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"El chart crea el `Gateway` y las rutas de Lamassu. No instala el controlador Envoy Gateway ni hace que el Service `LoadBalancer` generado sea accesible desde tu red."},"355":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Usa un único Gateway de Lamassu en los puertos 80 y 443 y deja que sus HTTPRoutes distribuyan el tráfico a todos los servicios. Proporciona a ese Gateway un único endpoint accesible mediante el balanceador del clúster, o reenvía tráfico desde un proxy externo o un dispositivo NAT. No necesitas un Gateway por servicio."},"356":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#cómo-encaja-el-despliegue","content":"El chart crea un `Gateway` compartido por cada release de Helm. Todos los recursos `HTTPRoute` gestionados por el chart se conectan a él. Envoy Gateway provisiona el data plane del proxy y un Service `LoadBalancer` de Kubernetes para ese Gateway."},"357":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#cómo-encaja-el-despliegue","content":"El valor `gateway.addresses` solo solicita una dirección al controlador del Gateway. No hace que una IP sea enrutable, abre un firewall, configura DNS ni crea NAT. Consulta Expón el Gateway antes de definirlo."},"358":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Kubernetes 1.24 o posterior"},"359":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Helm 3.2 o posterior"},"360":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Envoy Gateway 1.8 o posterior y una `GatewayClass`"},"361":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"cert-manager 1.14 o posterior; el chart actual renderiza recursos issuer y certificate de cert-manager"},"362":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"almacenamiento persistente adecuado para la configuración elegida de PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, VA y KMS"},"363":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"una implementación de balanceador o alguna otra ruta deliberada desde los clientes hasta el Gateway"},"364":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Los despliegues KMS que usan el sidecar PKCS#11 nativo requieren Kubernetes 1.29 o posterior."},"365":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-la-siguiente-página","content":"<Card title=\"Instala con Helm\" description=\"Prepara dependencias, configura valores, instala y verifica un despliegue controlado.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/helm\" />"},"366":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-la-siguiente-página","content":"<Card title=\"Expón el Gateway\" description=\"Elige un diseño de tráfico externo, comprende gateway.addresses y gestiona varios Gateways.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/networking\" />"},"367":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-la-siguiente-página","content":"<Card title=\"Usa Fastlane\" description=\"Arranca un entorno completo de evaluación o laboratorio con un script.\" href=\"/docs/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane\" />"},"368":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"Resolución de problemas de despliegue","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Operación"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting"},"369":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","content":"Diagnostica acceso, salud de los servicios y dependencias de infraestructura."},"370":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#secuencia-de-diagnóstico","content":"Secuencia de diagnóstico"},"371":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Reproduce una sola operación"},"372":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Separa cliente, Gateway y servicio"},"373":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Revisa el estado de Kubernetes"},"374":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Consulta el servicio afectado"},"375":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#valida-el-resultado-desde-fuera","content":"Valida el resultado desde fuera"},"376":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Recogida mínima de evidencias"},"377":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"No puedo iniciar sesión"},"378":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Todo devuelve 403 o 5xx"},"379":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Un pod no está Ready"},"380":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos no llegan"},"381":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"Observabilidad"},"382":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","content":"Empieza por localizar la capa que falla. Una respuesta del Gateway y un pod no preparado requieren evidencias distintas. Para emisión rechazada o resultados de validación, consulta el diagnóstico PKI; para enrolamiento, el diagnóstico EST."},"383":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#reproduce-una-sola-operación","content":"Anota hora en UTC, usuario o principal, recurso, endpoint y resultado. Evita repetir una acción destructiva como revocación o eliminación."},"384":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#separa-cliente-gateway-y-servicio","content":"Comprueba el código HTTP. Un 401 apunta a autenticación; un 403, a autorización; un 404, a ruta o recurso; un 5xx, al servicio o una dependencia."},"385":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#revisa-el-estado-de-kubernetes","content":"Localiza pods no preparados, reinicios, eventos recientes y el estado del release."},"386":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#consulta-el-servicio-afectado","content":"Revisa su endpoint /health y sus logs en la misma ventana temporal. Después sigue la dependencia indicada: PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, proveedor OIDC o motor criptográfico."},"387":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#valida-el-resultado-desde-fuera","content":"Para PKI, comprueba el certificado, la cadena, OCSP o CRL con el mismo tipo de cliente que utiliza producción."},"388":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Sustituye los marcadores por tu release, namespace y deployment reales."},"389":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Ejecuta también la prueba de conectividad del chart:"},"390":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"El test consulta la salud de CA, DMS Manager, Device Manager y VA, y comprueba que la UI devuelve HTML. Un test correcto confirma conectividad básica, no un flujo completo de emisión."},"391":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#recogida-mínima-de-evidencias","content":"Los servicios del chart exponen sondas de inicio, disponibilidad y vida sobre /health. Un pod puede estar ejecutándose pero no recibir tráfico si la readiness probe falla."},"392":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"Si recibes un 401:"},"393":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"comprueba que la autoridad OIDC de la UI sea accesible desde el navegador;"},"394":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"verifica emisor, audiencia y expiración del token;"},"395":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"confirma que el Gateway puede obtener las claves de la URI JWKS;"},"396":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"revisa que la ruta pública e interna del proveedor apunten al mismo realm."},"397":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"Si el login termina pero las APIs devuelven 403:"},"398":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"inspecciona los claims reales del token;"},"399":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"confirma que coinciden con un principal activo;"},"400":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"revisa las políticas concedidas al principal;"},"401":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"verifica que authz alcanza PostgreSQL y su JWKS."},"402":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#no-puedo-iniciar-sesión","content":"En una instalación nueva, confirma que el Job de migración terminó. Ese Job crea esquemas, migra authz, precarga políticas y provisiona los principales definidos en services.authz.bootstrap."},"403":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"La autorización externa falla cerrada por defecto. Si authz no está disponible, las rutas protegidas se bloquean."},"404":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Localiza el pod y Service de authz."},"405":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Comprueba /health, logs y conexión a su base de datos."},"406":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Verifica el DNS y puerto configurados en externalAuthorization."},"407":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"Comprueba que la ruta del check es /v1/ext\\_authz/check."},"408":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#todo-devuelve-403-o-5xx","content":"No cambies a failOpen: true como solución permanente: permitiría tráfico sin autorización durante la caída."},"409":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Revisa primero kubectl describe pod. Las causas habituales son:"},"410":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"credenciales o DNS incorrectos para PostgreSQL o RabbitMQ;"},"411":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"volumen persistente sin enlazar;"},"412":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"imagen inaccesible o política de pull incorrecta;"},"413":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"configuración inválida del motor criptográfico;"},"414":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"límites de CPU o memoria demasiado bajos;"},"415":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"migración previa incompleta."},"416":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Los valores genéricos solicitan 100 mCPU y 128 MiB y limitan a 500 mCPU y 512 MiB. Ajusta por servicio cuando haya OOMKills, throttling o arranques lentos."},"417":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-48","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Los motores KMS basados en filesystem y el almacenamiento local de VA utilizan volúmenes de acceso exclusivo. Mantén una réplica o migra a backends compartidos antes de habilitar autoscaling."},"418":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-49","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#un-pod-no-está-ready","content":"Las llamadas internas ahora fallan rápido en lugar de bloquearse para los clientes cubiertos por Proxy de salida: los intentos de conexión agotan el tiempo tras 30 segundos y los handshakes TLS tras 10 segundos. El conector del motor de autorización mantiene su propio transporte sin estos timeouts de conexión ni de handshake TLS; solo su timeout global de petición de 30 segundos acota cada llamada. Si un proxy de salida gestiona el tráfico de salida del clúster, comprueba las variables de entorno `HTTP_PROXY`, `HTTPS_PROXY` y `NO_PROXY` del pod e incluye los nombres de servicio internos en `NO_PROXY`."},"419":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-50","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Los eventos de dominio y auditoría dependen del publisher del bus:"},"420":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"verifica que esté habilitado en el servicio emisor;"},"421":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"comprueba conectividad y credenciales AMQP;"},"422":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"revisa exchange, routing key, colas y consumidores;"},"423":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"inspecciona dead-letter queues;"},"424":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"alerta sobre colas durables huérfanas y crecimiento de backlog."},"425":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#los-eventos-no-llegan","content":"Una caída del consumidor no siempre impide que la operación principal termine. Por eso debes monitorizar RabbitMQ y verificar de forma independiente la persistencia de auditoría."},"426":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"El chart puede habilitar instrumentación OpenTelemetry. Las trazas se exportan por OTLP HTTP y los logs pueden dirigirse a un endpoint compatible, como VictoriaLogs. Usa un identificador de correlación y la misma ventana temporal para unir Gateway, authz, servicio y dependencia."},"427":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"Antes de cerrar una incidencia, guarda:"},"428":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"causa confirmada;"},"429":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"alcance temporal y recursos afectados;"},"430":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"comandos o consultas utilizados;"},"431":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting#observabilidad","content":"cambio aplicado y forma de revertirlo;"},"432":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-41/es/deployment/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/p